    "OpenStreetMap and OpenTopoMap use collaborative mapping. Satellite uses Esri World Imagery. Topology colors and line widths apply immediately and are retained after saving.": "OpenStreetMap y OpenTopoMap usan cartografía colaborativa. Satélite usa Esri World Imagery. Los colores y grosores de la topología se aplican de inmediato y se conservan al guardar.",
    "OpenStreetMap, Light, Dark, CyclOSM, Humanitarian / HOT, OSM.DE and ÖPNVKarte use OpenStreetMap data; Topographic uses OpenTopoMap and Satellite uses Esri World Imagery. Light and Dark do not require an API key. Weather uses RainViewer, and cutaway terrain uses DEM Terrarium data.": "OpenStreetMap, Claro, Oscuro, CyclOSM, Humanitario / HOT, OSM.DE y ÖPNVKarte utilizan datos de OpenStreetMap; Topográfico utiliza OpenTopoMap y Satélite utiliza Esri World Imagery. Claro y Oscuro no requieren una clave API. Clima utiliza RainViewer y el relieve con corte utiliza datos DEM Terrarium.",
